 10/25\n</td>\n<td>Ingredient in Brahmi Ghrit\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>38\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa Sthana 10/27\n</td>\n<td>Ingredient in Vachadi Ghrit\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>39\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa Sthana 10/34\n</td>\n<td>Ingredient in Palankashadi  tail\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>40\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa Sthana 10/42\n</td>\n<td>As a Nasya dravya\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>41\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa Sthana 10/64\n</td>\n<td>Ingredient in Atattvabhinivesh  nashak yog\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>42\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa sthan\n<p>13/109 \n</p>\n</td>\n<td>In treatment  of Udara roga  (for parisheka)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>43\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa\n<p>Sthana13/104\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>In treatment  of pleehodara (takraprayoga)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>44\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa\n<p>Sthana13/124\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>As an  ingredient of gavakshyadi churna\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>45\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa\n<p>Sthana13/126\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>As an  ingredient of narayan churna\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>46\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa\n<p>Sthana13/134\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>As an  ingredient of hapushdya churna\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>47\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa\n<p>Sthana13/158\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>In  formulation of pippalyadi lavan\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>48\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa\n<p>Sthana13/163\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>In  formulation of Ksharvatika\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>49\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa\n<p>Sthana14/41\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>Used in  swedana kriya\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa\n<p>Sthana 14/53 \n</p>\n</td>\n<td>As an  ingredient of traushnadi churna\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>51\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa.  Chikitsa\n<p>Sthana 14/131\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>Used in  anuvasan basti\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>52\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa. Chi. 15/99\n</td>\n<td>Churna of  this drug with combination of ativisa,musta,devdaru etc. is given in aam and  shoola yukta mala\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>53\n</td>\n<td>Cha. Sa..Chi